               {0: "Their second premises differ.", 1: "The constructive affirms the antecedents; the destructive denies the consequents.", 2: "Both have two conditionals."},
               ["Constructive: second premise p v r, conclusion q v s.", "Destructive: second premise ~q v ~s, conclusion ~p v ~r."],
